WEBVTT

00:47:29.536 --> 00:47:34.039
but secondly, in the moments in my life
where I have been in love,

00:47:34.063 --> 00:47:35.386
where I've fallen in love,

00:47:35.410 --> 00:47:38.064
I have just as little power over it
as do I in grief.

00:47:38.088 --> 00:47:40.918
There are certain things
that happen to you as a human being

00:47:40.942 --> 00:47:43.203
that you cannot control or command

00:47:43.227 --> 00:47:46.194
that will come to you
at really inconvenient times

00:47:46.218 --> 00:47:48.710
and where you have to bow
in the human humility

00:47:48.734 --> 00:47:52.413
to the fact that there's something running
through you that's bigger than you.

00:47:52.437 --> 00:47:55.927
And that, I see, in our
very arrogant culture,

00:47:55.951 --> 00:47:57.333
that what we want is to --

00:47:57.357 --> 00:47:59.998
there's even the word "grief management."